msgstr "Gebruikersnaam of ID"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2481
msgid "Reset 2FA"
msgstr "2FA resetten"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2488
msgid "Submit a support ticket below. Our team will respond via email."
msgstr ""
"Dien hieronder een ondersteuningsticket in. Ons team zal per e-mail "
"reageren."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2491
msgid "Your name"
msgstr "Je naam"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2495
msgid "Reply-to email"
msgstr "Antwoord-e-mail"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2497
msgid ""
"We will reply to this address. Change it if you want the response to go "
"elsewhere."
msgstr ""
"We reageren op dit adres. Wijzig het als je de reactie ergens anders wilt "
"ontvangen."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2500
msgid "Website"
msgstr "Website"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2502
msgid ""
"Included automatically so support can identify your site. Change this under "
"Settings → General."
msgstr ""
"Automatisch toegevoegd zodat de ondersteuning je website kan identificeren. "
"Wijzig dit onder Instellingen → Algemeen."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2505
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Type"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2507 includes/class-segurium.php:7459
msgid "Bug report"
msgstr "Bugrapport"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2508 includes/class-segurium.php:7461
msgid "Feature request"
msgstr "Functieverzoek"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2509 includes/class-segurium.php:7463
msgid "General question"
msgstr "Algemene vraag"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2510
msgid "Report missed malware"
msgstr "Rapporteer gemiste malware"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2511
msgid "Other"
msgstr "Overig"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2515
msgid "Suspicious file"
msgstr "Verdacht bestand"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2517
msgid "Attach the file you believe is malware. Max 100 MB."
msgstr ""
"Voeg het bestand toe waarvan je denkt dat het malware is. Max. 100 MB."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2520
msgid "Message"
msgstr "Bericht"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2526
msgid ""
"Attach system information (WP version, PHP version, plugin version, active "
"plugins, last scan date)"
msgstr ""
"Systeeminformatie toevoegen (WP versie, PHP versie, plugin versie, actieve "
"plugins, datum laatste scan)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2530
msgid "Submit Ticket"
msgstr "Ticket indienen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2541
msgid "Enable Security Headers"
msgstr "Beveiligingsheaders inschakelen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2543
msgid ""
"Adds HTTP security response headers to all responses. Protects against "
"clickjacking, MIME sniffing, XSS, and protocol downgrade attacks."
msgstr ""
"Voegt HTTP-beveiligingsantwoord headers toe aan alle reacties. Beschermt "
"tegen clickjacking, MIME-sniffing, XSS en aanvallen via protocoldowngrade."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2547
msgid "Mode:"
msgstr "Modus:"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2551
msgid "Basic"
msgstr "Basis"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2551
msgid "X-Content-Type, X-Frame-Options, X-XSS-Protection"
msgstr "X-Content-Type, X-Frame-Options, X-XSS-Protection"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2552
msgid "Basic + Referrer-Policy, Permissions-Policy, HSTS"
msgstr "Basis + Referrer-Policy, Permissions-Policy, HSTS"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2553
msgid "Recommended + Cross-Origin policies, DNS prefetch, Cache-Control"
msgstr "Aanbevolen + Cross-Origin-beleid, DNS-prefetch, Cache-Control"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2554
msgid "configure each header individually"
msgstr "elke header afzonderlijk configureren"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2565
msgid ""
"This mode emits fixed preset values. Switch to Custom to override individual"
" headers."
msgstr ""
"Deze modus verzendt vaste voorinstellingswaarden. Schakel over naar "
"Aangepast om afzonderlijke headers te overschrijven."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2568
msgid "Header Values"
msgstr "Header waarden"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2572 includes/class-segurium.php:2586
#: includes/class-segurium.php:2643 includes/class-segurium.php:2652
#: includes/class-segurium.php:2662
msgid "Same origin"
msgstr "Zelfde oorsprong"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2573
msgid "Deny all"
msgstr "Alles weigeren"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2575
msgid "Prevents your site from being embedded in iframes on other domains."
msgstr ""
"Voorkomt dat je website wordt ingesloten in iframes op andere domeinen."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2582
msgid "No referrer"
msgstr "Geen verwijzer"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2583
msgid "No referrer when downgrade"
msgstr "Geen verwijzer bij downgrade"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2584
msgid "Origin only"
msgstr "Alleen oorsprong"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2585
msgid "Origin when cross-origin"
msgstr "Oorsprong bij cross-origin"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2587
msgid "Strict origin"
msgstr "Strikte oorsprong"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2588
msgid "Strict origin when cross-origin"
msgstr "Strikte oorsprong bij cross-origin"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2589
msgid "Unsafe URL"
msgstr "Onveilige URL"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2600 includes/class-segurium.php:2604
msgid "Disabled (recommended)"
msgstr "Uitgeschakeld (aanbevolen)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2601 includes/class-segurium.php:2605
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Ingeschakeld"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2602 includes/class-segurium.php:2606
msgid "Enabled with block mode"
msgstr "Ingeschakeld met blokkeermodus"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2604
msgid ""
"Explicitly turns off the legacy IE/old-Edge XSS filter, which had universal-"
"XSS bugs that could be weaponised. Modern browsers ignore this header; CSP "
"is the actual XSS defence."
msgstr ""
"Schakelt het verouderde XSS-filter van IE en oude Edge expliciet uit. Dit "
"filter had universele XSS-fouten die misbruikt konden worden. Moderne "
"browsers negeren deze header; CSP is de werkelijke verdediging tegen XSS."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2605
msgid ""
"Tells legacy browsers to sanitise reflections. The filter has false "
"positives that silently break valid pages and known UXSS bypasses. Not "
"recommended."
msgstr ""
"Geeft verouderde browsers opdracht om reflecties te schonen. Het filter "
"levert valse positieven op die geldige pagina's stilletjes breken en er zijn"
" UXSS-bypasses bekend. Niet aanbevolen."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2606
msgid ""
"Same filter as above, but blocks the page entirely on suspected reflection. "
"Same bugs, plus a timing side-channel that can leak cross-origin data. Not "
"recommended."
msgstr ""
"Zelfde filter als hierboven, maar blokkeert de pagina volledig bij "
"vermoedelijke reflectie. Dezelfde bugs, plus een timing-zijkanaal dat cross-"
"origin gegevens kan lekken. Niet aanbevolen."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2608
msgid "HSTS (Strict-Transport-Security)"
msgstr "HSTS (Strict-Transport-Security)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2612
msgid "Enable HSTS"
msgstr "HSTS inschakelen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2614
msgid "Forces browsers to use HTTPS. Only sent when SSL is active."
msgstr ""
"Dwingt browsers om HTTPS te gebruiken. Wordt alleen verzonden als SSL actief"
" is."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2618
msgid "Max-Age (seconds)"
msgstr "Max-Age (seconden)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2624
msgid "Include subdomains"
msgstr "Subdomeinen meenemen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2630
msgid "Preload"
msgstr "Preload"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2632
msgid ""
"Warning: preload is difficult to undo. Requires max-age at least 1 year and "
"subdomains included."
msgstr ""
"Waarschuwing: preload is moeilijk ongedaan te maken. Vereist een max-age van"
" minstens 1 jaar en het meenemen van subdomeinen."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2636
msgid ""
"Your site appears to be on a subdomain. Enabling includeSubDomains in HSTS "
"will affect all subdomains of the parent domain, including ones you may not "
"control."
msgstr ""
"Je website lijkt op een subdomein te staan. includeSubDomains inschakelen in"
" HSTS heeft invloed op alle subdomeinen van het hoofd domein, ook op "
"subdomeinen die je mogelijk niet beheert."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2638
msgid "Cross-Origin Policies"
msgstr "Cross-Origin-beleid"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2640
msgid "Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy"
msgstr "Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2642 includes/class-segurium.php:2651
msgid "Not set"
msgstr "Niet ingesteld"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2644
msgid "Same origin, allow popups"
msgstr "Zelfde oorsprong, pop-ups toestaan"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2645 includes/class-segurium.php:2663
msgid "Unsafe none"
msgstr "Onveilig geen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2649
msgid "Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy"
msgstr "Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2653
msgid "Same site"
msgstr "Zelfde website"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2654
msgid "Cross origin"
msgstr "Cross origin"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2658
msgid "Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy"
msgstr "Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2660
msgid "Not set (recommended)"
msgstr "Niet ingesteld (aanbevolen)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2661
msgid "Require CORP"
msgstr "CORP vereisen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2667
msgid "Control which browser features your site may use."
msgstr "Controleer welke browserfuncties je website mag gebruiken."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2671
msgid "Accelerometer"
msgstr "Versnellingsmeter"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2672
msgid "Autoplay"
msgstr "Automatisch afspelen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2673
msgid "Camera"
msgstr "Camera"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2674
msgid "Encrypted media"
msgstr "Versleutelde media"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2675
msgid "Fullscreen"
msgstr "Volledig scherm"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2676
msgid "Geolocation"
msgstr "Geolocatie"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2677
msgid "Gyroscope"
msgstr "Gyroscoop"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2678
msgid "Magnetometer"
msgstr "Magnetometer"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2679
msgid "Microphone"
msgstr "Microfoon"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2680
msgid "MIDI"
msgstr "MIDI"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2681
msgid "Payment"
msgstr "Betaling"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2682
msgid "USB"
msgstr "USB"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2692
msgid "Deny"
msgstr "Weigeren"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2693
msgid "Self only"
msgstr "Alleen zelf"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2694
msgid "Allow all"
msgstr "Alles toestaan"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2705
msgid "Send Content-Security-Policy header"
msgstr "Content-Security-Policy-header verzenden"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2707
msgid ""
"CSP restricts where scripts, styles, and other resources may load from, "
"mitigating XSS and injection. CSP is site-specific and can break themes or "
"page builders — start in report-only mode to surface violations before "
"enforcing."
msgstr ""
"CSP beperkt vanwaar scripts, stijlen en andere gegevensbronnen geladen mogen"
" worden en beperkt zo XSS en injectie. CSP is website specifiek en kan "
"thema's of page builders breken — begin in de alleen-rapporteren modus om "
"overtredingen zichtbaar te maken voordat je gaat afdwingen."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2713
msgid "Report-only (recommended for first deploy)"
msgstr "Alleen rapporteren (aanbevolen voor eerste implementatie)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2714
msgid "Enforce"
msgstr "Afdwingen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2716
msgid ""
"Report-only sends Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only — the browser logs "
"violations but still loads blocked resources. Enforce sends Content-"
"Security-Policy and blocks them."
msgstr ""
"Alleen rapporteren stuurt Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only — de browser "
"logt overtredingen maar laadt geblokkeerde bronnen toch. Afdwingen stuurt "
"Content-Security-Policy en blokkeert ze."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2719
msgid "Policy directives"
msgstr "Beleidsrichtlijnen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2722
msgid ""
"Single line of directives separated by semicolons. The default starter "
"policy permits Gutenberg and most themes; tighten once your reports are "
"clean."
msgstr ""
"Eén regel met richtlijnen, gescheiden door puntkomma's. Het standaard "
"startbeleid staat Gutenberg en de meeste thema's toe; scherp het aan zodra "
"je rapporten schoon zijn."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2723
msgid "CSP reference (MDN)"
msgstr "CSP-referentie (MDN)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2727
msgid "Report URI (optional)"
msgstr "Rapport URI (optioneel)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2729
msgid ""
"When set, browsers will POST violation reports to this URL. Appended "
"automatically as report-uri unless your directives already contain one."
msgstr ""
"Indien ingesteld sturen browsers overtredingsrapporten via POST naar deze "
"URL. Wordt automatisch toegevoegd als report-uri, tenzij je richtlijnen er "
"al een bevatten."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2733
msgid "Cookie Hardening"
msgstr "Cookie-hardening"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2737
msgid "Add SameSite attribute to auth cookies"
msgstr "SameSite attribuut toevoegen aan auth cookies"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2739
msgid ""
"Adds SameSite flag to WordPress session cookies. Protects against CSRF "
"attacks. Mozilla Observatory penalizes missing SameSite."
msgstr ""
"Voegt de SameSite vlag toe aan WordPress-sessiecookies. Beschermt tegen CSRF"
" aanvallen. Mozilla Observatory bestraft het ontbreken van SameSite."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2743
msgid "SameSite value"
msgstr "SameSite waarde"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2745
msgid "Lax (recommended)"
msgstr "Lax (aanbevolen)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2748
msgid ""
"Strict may break OAuth/SSO login flows that redirect back to your site."
msgstr ""
"Strict kan OAuth/SSO login flows breken die terug redirecten naar je "
"website."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2759
msgid "Headers Preview"
msgstr "Voorbeeld van headers"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2771
msgid "Enable Information Shield"
msgstr "Informatieschild inschakelen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2773
msgid ""
"Reduces WordPress information disclosure by removing version fingerprints, "
"discovery endpoints, and unnecessary metadata from HTTP headers and HTML "
"output."
msgstr ""
"Vermindert WordPress informatieblootstelling door versievingerafdrukken, "
"detectie-endpoints en onnodige metagegevens uit HTTP-headers en HTML uitvoer"
" te verwijderen."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2776
msgid "Enable All Recommended"
msgstr "Alle aanbevolen inschakelen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2780
msgid "HTTP Header Disclosure"
msgstr "HTTP-header-blootstelling"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2784
msgid "Remove X-Powered-By header"
msgstr "X-Powered-By header verwijderen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2786
msgid "Removes the header that reveals your PHP version."
msgstr "Verwijdert de header die je PHP versie onthult."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2792
msgid "Remove Server header"
msgstr "Server header verwijderen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2794
msgid ""
"Removes the header that identifies your web server software. Best-effort."
msgstr ""
"Verwijdert de header die je webserver software identificeert. Best-effort."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2800
msgid "Remove X-Pingback header"
msgstr "X-Pingback header verwijderen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2802
msgid "Hides the pingback/XML-RPC endpoint URL from response headers."
msgstr "Verbergt de pingback/XML-RPC endpoint URL in de reactie headers."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2807
msgid "Remove REST API Link: header"
msgstr "REST-API Link: header verwijderen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2809
msgid "Removes the HTTP Link header that advertises the REST API endpoint."
msgstr "Verwijdert de HTTP link header die het REST-API endpoint adverteert."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2814
msgid "Remove Shortlink Link: header"
msgstr "Shortlink Link: header verwijderen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2816
msgid "Removes the rel=shortlink HTTP header."
msgstr "Verwijdert de HTTP header rel=shortlink."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2819
msgid "HTML Meta and Links"
msgstr "HTML-meta en links"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2823
msgid "Remove WordPress generator tag"
msgstr "WordPress generator tag verwijderen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2825
msgid ""
"Removes the meta generator tag and RSS generator that reveal your WordPress "
"version."
msgstr ""
"Verwijdert de meta generator tag en de RSS generator die je WordPress versie"
" onthullen."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2830
msgid "Remove RSD link"
msgstr "RSD link verwijderen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2832
msgid "Removes the Really Simple Discovery endpoint link from HTML head."
msgstr "Verwijdert de Really Simple Discovery endpoint link uit de HTML head."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2837
msgid "Remove WLW manifest link"
msgstr "WLW manifestlink verwijderen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2839
msgid ""
"Removes the Windows Live Writer manifest link. Only needed if you use WLW to"
" write posts."
msgstr ""
"Verwijdert de Windows Live Writer manifest link. Alleen nodig als je WLW "
"gebruikt om berichten te schrijven."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2844
msgid "Remove REST API discovery link"
msgstr "REST-API detectielink verwijderen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2846
msgid ""
"Removes the discovery link tag from HTML head. The REST API itself remains "
"functional at /wp-json/."
msgstr ""
"Verwijdert de detectielink tag uit de HTML head. De REST-API zelf blijft "
"functioneel op /wp-json/."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2851
msgid "Remove oEmbed discovery links"
msgstr "Detectielinks van oEmbed verwijderen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2853
msgid ""
"Prevents other sites from showing rich embed previews when linking to your "
"content."
msgstr ""
"Voorkomt dat andere websites uitgebreide insluitvoorbeelden tonen bij het "
"linken naar je inhoud."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2858
msgid "Remove shortlink meta tag"
msgstr "Shortlink metatag verwijderen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2860
msgid "Removes the shortlink link tag from HTML head."
msgstr "Verwijdert de shortlink link tag uit de HTML head."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2865
msgid "Remove emoji scripts and styles"
msgstr "Emoji scripts en stijlen verwijderen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2867
msgid ""
"Removes the WordPress emoji polyfill JavaScript and CSS. Modern browsers "
"have native emoji support."
msgstr ""
"Verwijdert de WordPress emoji polyfill JavaScript en CSS. Moderne browsers "
"hebben native emoji-ondersteuning."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2872
msgid "Remove RSS/Atom feed links"
msgstr "RSS/Atom feedlinks verwijderen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2874
msgid ""
"May break RSS readers and WordPress.com Reader. Only enable if your site "
"does not use RSS feeds."
msgstr ""
"Kan RSS lezers en WordPress.com Reader breken. Schakel dit alleen in als je "
"website geen RSS feeds gebruikt."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2879
msgid "Remove adjacent post links"
msgstr "Aangrenzende berichtlinks verwijderen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2881
msgid "Removes prev/next post rel links from HTML head."
msgstr "Verwijdert vorige/volgende rel-links voor berichten uit de HTML-head."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2884
msgid "Asset Fingerprinting"
msgstr "Asset vingerafdrukken"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2888
msgid "Remove version query strings"
msgstr "Versie querystrings verwijderen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2890
msgid ""
"Strips ?ver= from CSS and JavaScript URLs. Browser-cached assets may become "
"stale after plugin or theme updates."
msgstr ""
"Verwijdert ?ver= uit CSS en JavaScript URL's. Door de browser gecachte "
"assets kunnen verouderd raken na plugin of thema updates."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2897
msgid "Disable XML-RPC entirely"
msgstr "XML-RPC volledig uitschakelen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2899
msgid ""
"Some plugins (Jetpack, WordPress mobile app) require XML-RPC. Disable only "
"if you do not use them."
msgstr ""
"Sommige plugins (Jetpack, WordPress mobiele app) vereisen XML-RPC. Schakel "
"dit alleen uit als je ze niet gebruikt."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2911
msgid "Security Self-Check"
msgstr "Zelfcontrole beveiliging"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2913
msgid ""
"Segurium runs the same checks as leading external security scanners, plus "
"WordPress-specific hardening checks, and grades your site A+ to F. Results "
"are saved until the next run."
msgstr ""
"Segurium voert dezelfde controles uit als toonaangevende externe "
"beveiligingsscanners, plus WordPress specifieke hardening controles, en "
"beoordeelt je website van A+ tot F. De resultaten worden opgeslagen tot de "
"volgende uitvoering."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2932
msgid "Check results"
msgstr "Controleresultaten"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2934
msgid "Independent verification"
msgstr "Onafhankelijke verificatie"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2936
msgid "Cross-check results with these public scanners:"
msgstr "Vergelijk de resultaten met deze openbare scanners:"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2939
msgid "securityheaders.com"
msgstr "securityheaders.com"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2940
msgid "Mozilla Observatory"
msgstr "Mozilla Observatory"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2954
msgid "Cleanup: 3 files / 30 days"
msgstr "Opruiming: 3 bestanden / 30 dagen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2955
msgid "Full malware detection — same findings as Pro"
msgstr "Volledige malware-detectie — dezelfde bevindingen als Pro"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2956
msgid "Auto-fix and Bulk Fix All"
msgstr "Automatische reparatie en Alles oplossen in bulk"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2957
msgid "Hardening: 2FA, brute-force, geo-blocking, firewall, security headers"
msgstr ""
"Versterking: 2FA, brute-force, geo-blokkering, firewall, beveiligingsheaders"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2958
msgid "File-integrity monitoring (core / plugins / themes)"
msgstr "Monitoring van bestandsintegriteit (core / plugins / thema's)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2959
msgid "Migration importer (Wordfence, AIOS, Solid Security)"
msgstr "Migratie importeerfunctie (Wordfence, AIOS, Solid Security)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2960
msgid "Community support"
msgstr "Community-ondersteuning"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2963
msgid "Unlimited cleanup"
msgstr "Onbeperkte opruiming"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2964
msgid "Everything in Free"
msgstr "Alles uit Free"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2965
msgid "Email support, priority queue"
msgstr "E-mailondersteuning, prioriteitswachtrij"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2973
msgid ""
"Every feature ships on every install. Pro lifts the monthly cleanup cap."
msgstr ""
"Elke functie wordt meegeleverd bij elke installatie. Pro heft de "
"maandelijkse opruimingslimiet op."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2980 includes/class-segurium.php:3003
msgid "Current plan"
msgstr "Huidig abonnement"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2983 includes/class-segurium.php:3208
msgid "Free"
msgstr "Gratis"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2985
msgid "Every feature, on every site. Cleanups capped at 3 per 30 days."
msgstr ""
"Elke functie, op elke website. Opruimingen beperkt tot 3 per 30 dagen."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:2990
msgid "forever"
msgstr "voor altijd"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3012
msgid "Unlimited cleanup. Same features as Free, with no monthly cap."
msgstr ""
"Onbeperkte opruiming. Dezelfde functies als Free, zonder maandelijkse "
"limiet."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3017
msgid "/year per site"
msgstr "/jaar per website"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3029
msgid "14-day money-back guarantee."
msgstr "Niet-goed-geld-terug-garantie van 14 dagen."

#. translators: 1: opening anchor tag, 2: closing anchor tag
#: includes/class-segurium.php:3040
msgid ""
"Bundles for 5 and 25 sites, plus 100+ quotes, on "
"%1$ssegurium.com/pricing/%2$s."
msgstr ""
"Bundels voor 5 en 25 websites, plus offertes voor 100+ websites, op "
"%1$ssegurium.com/pricing/%2$s."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3058
msgid "Scan Settings"
msgstr "Scaninstellingen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3061
msgid ""
"Exclude files from scan that match these wildcard patterns (one per line)"
msgstr ""
"Sluit bestanden uit van de scan die overeenkomen met deze jokerpatronen (één"
" per regel)"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3063
msgid ""
"Use * as a wildcard. For example, *.log will exclude all log files. vendor/*"
" will exclude the vendor directory and everything inside it."
msgstr ""
"Gebruik * als wildcard. Bijvoorbeeld: *.log sluit alle logbestanden uit. "
"vendor/* sluit de map vendor en alles erin uit."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3071
msgid ""
"When enabled, file contents may be shared with Segurium Cloud for advanced "
"malware detection and cloud-powered cleanup. Only suspicious files are "
"transmitted. Turn it off for On-premise mode: scans then send SHA-256 "
"hashes, file paths, and metadata only, and a file the cloud cannot identify "
"by hash stays unresolved. Reporting a false positive or attaching a file to "
"a support ticket still sends that file, because you pick it yourself."
msgstr ""
"Wanneer ingeschakeld, kan bestandsinhoud worden gedeeld met Segurium Cloud "
"voor geavanceerde malwaredetectie en cloudgestuurde opschoning. Alleen "
"verdachte bestanden worden verzonden. Schakel het uit voor de on-premise "
"modus: scans versturen dan alleen SHA-256 hashes, bestandspaden en metadata,"
" en een bestand dat de cloud niet via hash kan identificeren blijft "
"onopgelost. Bij het rapporteren van een vals positief of het toevoegen van "
"een bestand aan een ondersteuningsticket wordt dat bestand nog steeds "
"verzonden, omdat je het zelf selecteert."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3076
msgid "Wipe encrypted backups when the plugin is uninstalled"
msgstr "Versleutelde back-ups wissen wanneer de plugin wordt verwijderd"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3078
msgid ""
"Off (default): encrypted backups of deleted components and cured files are "
"kept in the uploads/segurium-data directory after uninstall, so a reinstall "
"can still restore them. Turn on only if you want a hard deletion on "
"uninstall."
msgstr ""
"Uit (standaard): versleutelde back-ups van verwijderde componenten en "
"opgeschoonde bestanden blijven na deïnstallatie bewaard in de map "
"uploads/segurium-data, zodat een herinstallatie ze nog kan terugzetten. "
"Schakel dit alleen in als je bij deïnstallatie een definitieve verwijdering "
"wilt."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3084
msgid "Email me about findings"
msgstr "Stuur mij e-mails over bevindingen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3086
msgid ""
"Send a daily digest of malware verdicts and successful cleanups, delivered "
"from support@segurium.com. At most one email per site per 24 hours."
msgstr ""
"Stuur een dagelijkse samenvatting van malware-oordelen en geslaagde "
"opschoningen, afgeleverd vanaf support@segurium.com. Maximaal één e-mail per"
" website per 24 uur."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3087
msgid "Alert email address"
msgstr "Waarschuwing e-mailadres"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3095
msgid "Leave blank to use the WordPress site admin email."
msgstr ""
"Laat leeg om het beheerders e-mailadres van de WordPress website te "
"gebruiken."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3105
msgid "Automatically clean detected malware"
msgstr "Gedetecteerde malware automatisch opschonen"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3107
msgid ""
"After every scheduled or real-time scan, files with a known malware or "
"injection verdict are cleaned without requiring a click. Files you have "
"ignored (by path or by hash) are skipped."
msgstr ""
"Na elke geplande of realtime scan worden bestanden met een bekende malware- "
"of injectie-uitspraak opgeschoond zonder dat je hoeft te klikken. Bestanden "
"die je hebt genegeerd (op pad of op hash) worden overgeslagen."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3117
msgid "Scheduled Scan"
msgstr "Geplande scan"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3119
msgid ""
"Run a full malware scan automatically on a recurring schedule. A scheduled "
"scan does the same work as a manual scan, but does not require you to keep "
"your browser open. A scheduled tick that fires while a manual scan is "
"already in progress is skipped, not queued."
msgstr ""
"Voer automatisch een volledige malwarescan uit volgens een terugkerend "
"schema. Een geplande scan doet hetzelfde werk als een handmatige scan, maar "
"vereist niet dat je je browser open houdt. Een geplande scan die start "
"terwijl er al een handmatige scan loopt, wordt overgeslagen en niet in de "
"wachtrij geplaatst."

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3146
msgid "Save Schedule"
msgstr "Planning opslaan"

#: includes/class-segurium.php:3154
msgid ""
"Import settings from other security plugins into Segurium. Existing Segurium"
" settings are preserved; imported data is merged."
msgstr ""
"Importeer instellingen van andere beveiligingsplugins naar Segurium. "
"Bestaande Segurium instellingen blijven behouden; geïmporteerde gegevens "
"worden samengevoegd."

